  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This might be an out-of-scope request, but stickers should have the ability to persist even if the user leaves the instance. Since they can still be moderated without the user being present, it would be nice to leave a mark in an instance, even long after the user is gone. Of course, once the instance is empty and refreshes, it clears out.",
